WEBVTT

01:03:27.787 --> 01:03:31.208
And to me, the highest thing
to shoot for in life is moral joy.

01:03:31.232 --> 01:03:33.966
When you're serving a cause
and you care about it so much,

01:03:33.990 --> 01:03:36.003
you're not thinking about yourself at all.

01:03:36.027 --> 01:03:39.443
So letting the self slip away
is what I'm shooting for in life,

01:03:39.467 --> 01:03:40.859
and I don't always get there.

01:03:40.883 --> 01:03:43.421
In fact, I never get there.
I never spend a whole day.

01:03:43.445 --> 01:03:44.939
But it's what I'm shooting for.

01:03:44.963 --> 01:03:47.977
When my column comes out,
I always check to see, "How did it do?

01:03:48.001 --> 01:03:49.724
Was it popular, was it not popular?"

01:03:49.748 --> 01:03:52.702
That's something I should never do,
but I'm stuck with myself.

01:03:52.726 --> 01:03:54.831
But the moments when
you can forget yourself

01:03:54.855 --> 01:03:56.565
and lose yourself in a cause ...

01:03:56.589 --> 01:03:59.751
And the people I see
who radiate moral joy --

01:03:59.775 --> 01:04:01.488
they're not at stake.